":"d:see-you-at-work-tomorrow-sub-espanol","title":"See You at Work Tomorrow!","kind":"series","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTP1MKGz5kIrXCpb3HTgzVyIW6l.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zftF4KDGuhAGIA50bywcCXPjz5f.jpg","year":"2026","rating":8.8,"overview":"Cha Ji-yoon is a 7th-year corporate worker who's tired of both work and dating. She crosses paths with Kang Si-woo, the cynical boss with a terrifying reputation. Unexpectedly, she regains spark in her life as she gets to know the kindness behind his stern words. Amid repeated commutes, accidents at work, and failed relationships, the two become each other's irreplaceable anchor.","ids":{"tmdb":289763}},{"id":"d-grupo-de-estudio-latino-sub-espanol","ref":"d:grupo-de-estudio-latino-sub-espanol","title":"Grupo de Estudio","kind":"series","badges":["Latino"],"lang":"es-419","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLrEtysTwvVZESavwufnoGIaq8j.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A32KgHacV0pCJNYIH4JrQb5djGu.jpg","year":"2025","rating":8.6,"overview":"Apodada «la escuela de los futuros delincuentes», la Escuela Técnica Superior de Yuseong no es precisamente el lugar ideal para estudiar. Ga-min, una rareza entre sus compañeros, es un estudiante con un único objetivo: entrar en la universidad. En una escuela en la que cada uno va a lo suyo, es rechazado por innumerables grupos de estudio antes de decidir formar el suyo propio. ¿Será capaz de superar las adversidades y alcanzar sus sueños?","ids":{"tmdb":233347}},{"id":"d-amor-sin-variables-latino-sub-espanol","ref":"d:amor-sin-variables-latino-sub-espanol","title":"Amor sin Variables","kind":"series","badges":["Latino"],"lang":"es-419","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/97PM3x5ejUtWRYbkHYNL8u0BYHM.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sWgf0zfmjKiwXl5ND2b9apkChkV.jpg","year":"2026","rating":8.8,"overview":"Eui-ju, estudiante tímida de día y novelista romántica de noche, se inspira cuando a