ol","ref":"d:perfect-crown-sub-espanol","title":"Perfect Crown","kind":"series","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocXkHSslrSWMz2ZJGl5MjF6dQr3.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ekykPwvAywJRjFEnUoCFWTO9O3.jpg","year":"2026","rating":8.9,"overview":"In 21st-century Korea under a constitutional monarchy, a chaebol heiress with everything but status tries to take control of her future after crossing paths with a lonely prince with nothing but his title. Together, bound by a contract marriage, they begin a class-defying romance to rewrite destiny.","ids":{"tmdb":278573}},{"id":"d-hacemos-lo-que-podemos-latino-sub-espanol","ref":"d:hacemos-lo-que-podemos-latino-sub-espanol","title":"Hacemos lo que podemos","kind":"series","badges":["Latino"],"lang":"es-419","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EQMMCm2IMUxU8m9Opq0trg7vAN.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ZXZi107TbfBJFGT4cnqbavQIoc.jpg","year":"2026","rating":8.4,"overview":"Tras 20 años tratando de hacer su primera película, un aspirante a director toca fondo. Pero entonces conoce a una productora abrumada que le ayuda a redescubrir su valor.","ids":{"tmdb":289424}},{"id":"d-we-are-all-trying-here-sub-espanol","ref":"d:we-are-all-trying-here-sub-espanol","title":"We Are All Trying Here","kind":"series","badges":["Subtitulado"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfCOKDJHo3yOtiPP37LBcelrYs2.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4ZXZi107TbfBJFGT4cnqbavQIoc.jpg","year":"2026","rating":8.4,"overview":"An aspiring director hits rock bottom after 20 years chasing his debut — until he meets an overwhelmed producer who helps him rediscover his self-worth.","ids":{"tmdb":289424}},{"id":"d-un-amor-que-no-se-agota-latino-sub-espanol","ref":"d:un-amor-que-no-se-agota-latino-sub-espanol","title":"Un amor que no se agota","kind":"series","badges":["Latino"],"lang":"es-419","poster":"https://www.doramasyt.com/thumbs/imagen/un-amor-que-no-se-agota-latino